This is an extended version of Lander that has a
larger landscape and keyboard support.

It should work on all versions of RISC OS.

To fly using the mouse, just play as normal.

To fly using the keyboard, either press "K" while
on the launchpad and use the following keys:

S       Pitch down
X       Pull up
<       Rotate anti-clockwise
>       Rotate clockwise
A       Fire
Space   Thrust
?       Hover

Or press "L" while on the launchpad and use the
following keys:

?       Pitch down
"       Pull up
Z       Rotate anti-clockwise
X       Rotate clockwise
Return  Fire
Space   Thrust
Shift   Hover

You can use either Shift key to hover.

Press "J" while on the launchpad to switch back
to the mouse.

See lander.bbcelite.com for details.

